OL,3,AFrance is divided over who to blame for
OL,4,Aand what to learn from weekend riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FI'd stopped her and her friend to ask
OL,7,Fwhat they thought of what happened on
OL,8,FSaturday. Elisabeth was so upset that,
OL,9,Fwhen she spoke, she seemed close to
OL,10,Ftears.
OL,12,F"My friend thinks this is civil war in
OL,13,FFrance but I don't. Saturday is about
OL,14,Fsomething else entirely."
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
