OL,3,AMan charged with attack on Australia MP
OL,4,Ato face court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year-old man has been charged
OL,7,Fafter Australian MP Helen Haines was
OL,8,Fhit by a car in the state of Victoria
OL,9,Fon Monday.
OL,11,FThe suspect will appear in court on
OL,12,FWednesday to face charges of dangerous
OL,13,Fdriving causing serious injury,
OL,14,Fintentionally causing serious injury
OL,15,Fand the federal offence of causing harm
OL,16,Fto a public official.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
